{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>העטופים</b> Twice in the Masorah: העטופים ללבן, העטופים ברעב. Meaning: he gave him the lean ones that died in the famine. Alternatively: because Jacob did something that appeared like trickery, it caused his sons to be enveloped in famine."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:25.760799595Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}